  <item>
    <title>猎头用AI最纠结的问题：数据焦虑+封号恐惧。真相到底是怎样？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7d87ee36641f136d87ac42</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7d87ee36641f136d87ac42</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 09:04:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>本期讨论的 5 个核心问题&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></h2><p><span>&nbsp; 1. AI 寻访能不能用？</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; 2. 会不会封号？&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; 3. 数据是不是战略问题？</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; 4. 跨界玩家会抢生意吗？&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; 5. 猎头的护城河是什么？</span></p><p><strong><span>一些本次谈话中的核心观点：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>AI寻访会封号吗？讨论封号是个战术问题，讨论数据是个战略问题。</span></p></li><li><p><span>为什么我不赞同AI是种工具？模型会过时，数据不会。AI能帮你洗数据，提高数据质量。但不能比编数据。</span></p></li><li><p><span>平台不是封 AI，平台封异常动作。AI的效率在于模仿人的动作，相对精准地工作。爬数据是肯定会被封</span></p></li><li><p><span>跨界玩家有客户有资本，你有什么？</span></p></li><li><p><span>先动起来，拥抱AI比什么都重要。</span></p></li></ul><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><h2><span>&nbsp;</span></h2><p></p>]]></description>
